flowchart LR
    Head[HEAD Tree] --> HeadIndex[比较 HEAD 与索引]
    Index[索引] --> HeadIndex
    Index --> IndexWorktree[比较索引与工作区]
    Worktree[工作区] --> IndexWorktree
    Ignore[ignore 规则] --> Untracked[未跟踪文件]
    Worktree --> Untracked
    HeadIndex --> Staged[已暂存: added / modified / deleted]
    IndexWorktree --> Unstaged[未暂存: modified / deleted]
